  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": 14052,
      "content": "On Tuesday, October 20 at 7:04 a.m. ET, Falcon 9 launched the <a href= https://sxcontent9668.azureedge.us/cms-assets/assets/Bandwagon_Y2_1_7ac9d38ded.png target=\"_\">Bandwagon-5</a> mission to orbit from Space Launch Complex 40 (SLC-40) at Cape Canaveral Space Force Station in Florida. On board this mission were 32 payloads including cubesats, microsats, and reentry vehicles"
    },
    {
      "id": 14053,
      "content": "This was the 19th flight of the first stage booster supporting this mission, which previously launched Crew-9, RRT-1, Firefly Blue Ghost Mission 1, Fram2, SXM-10, MTG-S1, EchoStar XXV, SXM-11, and now 10 Starlink missions. Following stage separation, the first stage landed on the A Shortfall of Gravitas droneship, which was stationed in the Atlantic Ocean."
    }
  ]
